{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "status": "request-only-no-recordings",
  "app_id": "a4-movement",
  "items": [
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "مرحبًا في مغامرات الحركة. اختر مغامرة مع مرافقك. نجهز مكانًا آمنًا، ونتعلم قاعدة واحدة، ثم نضع الشاشة جانبًا ونلعب. يمكنك اللعب جالسًا، أو طلب المساعدة والتوقف متى احتجت.",
      "path": "audio/silma/1bd7f20a8be59876.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "إشارة توقف",
      "path": "audio/silma/3ec029a0bbd4796e.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "مساحة خالية ومرافق يعرض بطاقة التوقف.",
      "path": "audio/silma/3b5a6d059fc5cab5.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "عندما ترى الكف، توقف بهدوء. عند رؤية الكرة، تحرك بلطف.",
      "path": "audio/silma/f1c55301f6d0b30d.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "حرك يديك بلطف. عند رؤية الكف، ضعهما على الطاولة أو في حضنك.",
      "path": "audio/silma/f798797c54da515a.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "حرك يدًا واحدة أو إصبعًا بالقدر المريح لك، ثم استرح.",
      "path": "audio/silma/25a7edc5798090d7.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "حركة لطيفة في المكان",
      "path": "audio/silma/622685aa87906e5b.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "توقف وراحة",
      "path": "audio/silma/deefb67c372a57fe.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "الآن نعكس القاعدة: الكرة تعني توقف. الكف يعني حركة لطيفة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/e36ee8d2fbeb815b.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "استجبت لإشارة واتفقنا على قاعدة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/a1e63f4a7114978c.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "مسار الألوان",
      "path": "audio/silma/cd85c00cf553a158.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "بطاقتان كبيرتان: دائرة حمراء ومربع أزرق، على أرض غير زلقة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/426a722fb25f3245.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "اذهب بخطوات مريحة إلى الدائرة الحمراء، ثم أشر إلى المربع الأزرق.",
      "path": "audio/silma/90a9bbd728f047d9.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أشر إلى الدائرة الحمراء على الطاولة، ثم أشر إلى المربع الأزرق.",
      "path": "audio/silma/f53e8c0beeb02938.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "اختر بعينك أو بإشارة مريحة الدائرة الحمراء، ثم المربع الأزرق.",
      "path": "audio/silma/ed08cae22e1d63fa.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "الدائرة الحمراء أولًا",
      "path": "audio/silma/3ac9c366a4097094.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "المربع الأزرق بعد ذلك",
      "path": "audio/silma/73dca018c9dd763f.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "الآن نبدأ بالمربع الأزرق ثم الدائرة الحمراء.",
      "path": "audio/silma/7e71d1143e932143.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نفذت ترتيب محطتين وجربت ترتيبًا جديدًا.",
      "path": "audio/silma/ffd17f20eb7ad2b9.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "قائد ثم تابع",
      "path": "audio/silma/a8a7e281212781bd.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "مرافق أو شريك ومساحة تسمح بحركة اليدين دون اصطدام.",
      "path": "audio/silma/ea957ffa51ed78fa.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "القائد يرفع يديه ثم يخفضهما. نتبعه، ثم نتبادل القيادة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/122088f688902c84.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نجلس في وضع مريح. يقلد الشريك إشارة اليد ثم يتبادل الدور معنا.",
      "path": "audio/silma/58f52821740b952f.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "ليختر كل مشارك إشارة صغيرة مريحة له، ويقلدها الآخر إن أراد.",
      "path": "audio/silma/591ceef1e33f92d9.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "يقود المرافق حركة واحدة",
      "path": "audio/silma/3b50ede661ca77d7.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أختار أنا الحركة التالية",
      "path": "audio/silma/1ab12d8546254ee4.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أنت القائد الآن. اختر حركة مريحة، واسأل شريكك إن كانت تناسبه.",
      "path": "audio/silma/dd85dc0fd749ac83.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "تناوبنا القيادة واخترنا حركة مناسبة لنا.",
      "path": "audio/silma/9f1def122ad789ad.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "تغيرت القاعدة",
      "path": "audio/silma/59d8b235da98d111.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "دائرة حمراء ومربع أزرق ومرافق لتذكيرنا بالقاعدة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/9634632bcf49fb1d.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "الدائرة الحمراء تعني أن نرفع اليد. المربع الأزرق يعني أن نضع اليد في الحضن.",
      "path": "audio/silma/b3467e1631ec8d83.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نطبق الإشارات ونحن جالسون براحة، دون الحاجة إلى الوقوف.",
      "path": "audio/silma/a50008d1b30f1bcc.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "يكفي أن نشير إلى الأعلى أو إلى الحضن، أو نختار بالنظر.",
      "path": "audio/silma/b8ca9307ea1f9bc0.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أجرب إشارة الدائرة الحمراء",
      "path": "audio/silma/519a234712d58dc2.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أجرب إشارة المربع الأزرق",
      "path": "audio/silma/b377c9c39d820799.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "تغيرت القاعدة: الدائرة الحمراء تعني اليد في الحضن، والمربع الأزرق يعني رفع اليد.",
      "path": "audio/silma/09bab32ec1c1490f.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "تذكرت قاعدة ثم جربت تغييرها مع التذكير عند الحاجة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/3f08785a4faa57ee.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "رحلة جلوسية",
      "path": "audio/silma/de509e108a0aedf2.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "مكان جلوس ثابت ومريح وبطاقتان واضحتان على الطاولة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/7a15f77c2f3f2f9d.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نلمس الطاولة برفق، ثم نرفع اليد بالقدر المريح، ثم نستريح.",
      "path": "audio/silma/142148b0b17457cf.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "اختر يدًا أو إصبعًا أو إشارة بالنظر. لا يلزم تقليد مدى حركة أي شخص.",
      "path": "audio/silma/1e37ebef934972e8.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "اختر إشارة واحدة مريحة، ثم توقف واسترح.",
      "path": "audio/silma/5aabc30f427bc169.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "إشارة على الطاولة",
      "path": "audio/silma/51049357628aa12c.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "رفع مريح لليد",
      "path": "audio/silma/28842fb176fe207a.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "راحة",
      "path": "audio/silma/aff980623bc2b109.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "اختر ترتيبًا جديدًا لإشارتين، أو كرر الإشارة التي تريحك.",
      "path": "audio/silma/85b7a641da262b53.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "اخترت حركة جلوسية مناسبة وتوقفت عندما احتجت.",
      "path": "audio/silma/5c4c1223edce3357.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "ننقل معًا",
      "path": "audio/silma/733d037c6a800be5.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "كرة كبيرة خفيفة وسطح منخفض أو مكانان قريبان ومرافق.",
      "path": "audio/silma/c12bb85f393eb23c.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نتفق على إشارة البداية، ثم نمرر الكرة الكبيرة برفق إلى شريكنا وننتظر عودتها.",
      "path": "audio/silma/38f0ba1b29e6f5ca.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نمرر الكرة على طاولة ثابتة منخفضة ونحن جالسون، دون مد الجسم بعيدًا.",
      "path": "audio/silma/fdf63d7daa6c1012.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نقرب الكرة بمساعدة المرافق، أو نشير إلى من دوره الآن.",
      "path": "audio/silma/405fa27a237d2378.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أتفق مع شريكي على البداية",
      "path": "audio/silma/49cb05a39b184e18.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أمرر برفق وأنتظر",
      "path": "audio/silma/40fae06fe13057c5.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أطلب توقفًا إن احتجت",
      "path": "audio/silma/8c33dc44f3708208.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "نتبادل من يبدأ، أو نقرب المكانين لتصبح المحاولة أريح.",
      "path": "audio/silma/290926328b04c210.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "تعاونت مع شريك ونسقنا الأدوار دون سباق.",
      "path": "audio/silma/748b7be2d7bd7a9c.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    }
  ]
}
